export anchor MailSlateStyle:
    number: 394
    screen: EmailClient
    name: Mail slate
    idea: A sober, professional three pane mail client in cool slate greys with one teal accent, where rules and steps of lightness do the organising and nothing decorates the work.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #171c22, the page, the message list and fields
        pane: #1f252d, the top bar, the folder column and the style sheet
        raised: #29313b, the open row and secondary buttons
        line: #343e4b, every rule and border
        ink: #e4e8ee, text
        muted: #9ba7b6, snippets, times and meta
        teal: #4fc1b0, the primary button, the unread dot, the open row bar and focus
        onTeal: #06221e, text on teal
        tealSoft: #1d3936, the current folder
        tealText: #7fd8ca, the current folder label and unread times
        star: #e9c46a, the filled star beside the word Starred
        clients: #8db6ff, the Clients label diamond
        invoices: #f2a970, the Invoices label diamond
        team: #c7a0f2, the Team label diamond
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 14px at 1.45. The open subject is 22px at 650, the list
        heading 16px at 650, the message body 15px at 1.65, unread senders
        and subjects 700, snippets 13px muted, folder group headings 11px
        caps at 650 with wide tracking.
    layout:
        A full width 52px top bar holds a teal square B mark with the name,
        a long search field, a teal Compose button and Mara Okafor with an
        initials disc. Below sit three panes. A 220px folder column lists
        Inbox 12, Starred, Snoozed, Sent, Drafts 2 and Archive with line
        icons, then the three labels each with a small rotated coloured
        square. A 360px list shows six messages as ruled rows with sender
        and time on top, subject, snippet and a meta line for label chips,
        the attachment and the star. The Northpass row is open, raised and
        marked by a teal inset bar on its left. The reader starts with a
        toolbar of Reply in teal, then Reply all, Forward, a divider,
        Snooze and Archive, then the subject, a Clients chip, a sender row
        with a round DW disc and the time, and the short body. Below 1100px
        the reader drops under the list. Below 760px the folders become a
        sideways scrolling strip above the list, and the reader follows.
    spacing: A 4px base, mostly 8 and 16. Rows pad 12 by 16px, the reader gutter is 28px.
    density: Medium. Six messages with snippets fill the list and the reader shows the whole note.
    corners: 6px buttons, fields and folder items, 4px chips, round avatars.
    borders: 1px #343e4b between panes and under every row. No cards.
    shadows: None. The open row has an inset 3px teal bar on its left edge.
    icons:
        16px line icons at 1.7 stroke. Unread is a teal dot plus bold text,
        starred a filled gold star plus the word, a label a rotated square
        plus the name, the attachment a clip plus 1 attachment.
    focus: A 2px teal outline offset 2px on every control and around the whole search field.
    tone: Plain nouns and verbs, such as Inbox, Mailboxes, Reply all and 1 attachment.
